WEBVTT


00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.600
And people didn't want to hire me

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:02.640
because I had no experience,

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:06.200
this is where Pereirão from theiro's workshop is born.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.160
Debora always faces life with great sweetness

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.720
and a smile on your face.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.959
There are people I've been picking up as soon as I arrive

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:14.479
approached,

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.680
that they so detonated,

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.720
so with a drooping countenance,

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:21.400
so full of trouble and I managed to get a smile out of it,

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.400
no matter how disguised it is.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.920
And a smile is much different from smiling with you.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.360
and laugh at you.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.080
Before I started home,

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.680
my heaven God must administer John's probe.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.640
Maria also has these problems

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.760
because I can't take it anymore because I'm already tired.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.240
And as Pereiram was different,

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.400
he made me 1 totally happy woman.

